  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Talking about your strengths",
     "texto": [
      "In an interview you may be asked about your **kvalifikasjoner** (qualifications), your experience and how you work with other people. **Fleksibel** means you can adapt; **nøyaktig**, that you work carefully."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Third-person possessives",
     "texto": [
      "**Hans** means «his»; **hennes**, «her»; **deres**, «their» or «your» (plural). Unlike **min/mi/mitt/mine**, these forms do not change with the gender or number of the thing owned: **hans CV**, **hennes erfaring**, **deres arbeidsplass**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
